From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:57:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-230: Accessories layer (CharSections base_section
 9, customization 5 / Lua 10: pasted over skin and markings, over the
 underwear on torso and upper legs, under items; cycled, gated and counted in
 the creator; OBJECT_FIELD_PADDING byte 3 reloads it) and per-choice
 facial-hair pieces (CharCustomizations.txt "choice ... tex=<piece>" =
 base_section 10, colour = hair colour, composited with the facial hair in
 both head compositors; a player with set slots draws the pieces instead of
 the legacy facial texture, NPCs keep it)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01URnr7tKsFMZq4VFsSKkj3S
